<pb facs="1063909" n="1"/>
<note>1715 Febr. 22</note>
  <opener><salute rend="center"><lb/>Viro Clarissimo Doctissimoque
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolao Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti.</rs></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Negotiorum meorum multitudo responsionem ad <rs key="B_991170517053105501" type="letter">tuas litteras</rs> <abbr>d.</abbr> <date when="1714-12-19">19
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teriti Decembris</date> ad me datas in hunc distulit diem. Celeber<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rimi <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs> Tui <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-120379260 pers_DE-588-115390405 pers_DE-588-1141836866">Discipuli</rs> istinc profecti <rs key="biblio_WPXENY2H biblio_W6BHQDM2 biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio">fasciculum</rs><note type="comment">Johannes Scheuchzer fragte seinen Bruder Johann Jakob in der Nachschrift zu einem <ref target="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/zuz/content/zoom/1018247">Brief</ref> aus Basel nach dem Verbleib eines für Michelotti bestimmten Pakets Bernoullis. Meyer habe es Johann Jakob bereits übergeben.</note> libro<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum vestrorum cum salute plurima dederunt mihi <date when="1715-02-14">ante
      <lb/>octo dies</date>: ex quorum Lectione magnam cepi hactenus, pluri<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mamque capiam posthac voluptatem. Optimam de Te
      <lb/>semper opinionem habui Vir Doctissime; meque latuit nun<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>quam Te ulli clarissimorum huius seculi Mathematicorum
      <lb/>haud esse secundum. Analyseos specimina eximia quae publi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ci iuris fecisti in <rs key="B_991170517023705501 B_991170517023405501 B_991170517023205501 B_991170430192305501 B_991170517022605501" type="letter">epistolis</rs> Tuis <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117601020">Montmortii</rs> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_69NKSR46">libro</rs> (quem ad
      <lb/>me misisti) adjectis satis superque ostendunt Tuam in
      <lb/>Mathematicis summam peritiam: quamobrem nescio qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>
      <lb/>fiat ut Amplissimi <rs type="organisation" key="org_DE-588-10021039-9">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i Patavini</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatores</rs> Mathema<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum Cathedram Tibi non offerant, Teque ad docendum non
      <lb/>vocent solemniter. Sed causam nosti Vir Clarissime. <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs> Tui
      <lb/>semper colendi dignitas, <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tas, gravitas, litter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, fama faciunt
      <lb/>ut <choice><orig>jidem</orig><reg>iidem</reg></choice> <abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatores</rs> potius <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">mo</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs>
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m Te percontentur ac expetant, eidemque salarium inso<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>litum nemini antehac solutum ab hac <abbr>Sereniss.<hi rend="sup">a</hi></abbr> et Poten<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tissima <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Republica</rs>, proponant. Omnia me vestra delectant;
      <lb/>quare quod ad me pertinet non minus Tuum qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs> adventum vehementer cupio. <abbr>Illustriss.</abbr> et <abbr>Excellent.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzini</rs> <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci Procuratoris iussu, etiam atque etiam
      <lb/>rogavi (<rs key="B_991170515019005501" type="letter">epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></rs> ad ipsum <add>ultim<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></add>) Doctissimum <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs>
      <lb/>Tuum ut meis faveret votis, dignareturque salarium
      <lb/>1500 sesquiflorenorum germanicorum annuatim solven<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dorum acceptare. Conscius quanti ipsum faciam, quantaque
      <lb/>eius erga me sit benevolentia, ab eodem etiam hac vice
<pb facs="1063910" n="2"/>
      <lb/>petere quod pridem pluries petii, non dubitavi. Solemni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ter vocabitur ad edocendum mathematicas disciplinas in
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavina Urbe</rs> per sexennium salario annuo 1500 sesqui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>florenorum germanicorum persoluto. Sexennio absoluto poterit
      <lb/>in <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Patriam</rs> redire si lubebit; Tuque eo casu eidem
      <lb/>ipsi succedes. Perpendat qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> nunquam satis lauda<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tus quod <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavii</rs> parvis vivitur expensis: alimenta
      <lb/>etenim, vinum aliaque ad vivendum necessaria parvuo
      <lb/>stant. Tua multum interest mi iucundissime Nicolae; ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnique refert ad decus et laudem vestr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> domus <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patrui</rs>
      <lb/>ad nos migratio. Quapropter roga iterum atque iterum
      <lb/>nomine meo <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs> Tuum (cui salutem plu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rimam mitto, cuique habeo gratiam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>d tanta humani<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tate doctissimorum <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_WPXENY2H biblio_W6BHQDM2 biblio_RTB4565Q">operum</rs> suorum exemplaria aliquot
      <lb/>mihi impertiverit) ut vocationibus ade<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> honorificis as<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sentiri haud dedignetur. Quod ut facias ita a Te peto ut ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>iore studio magisve ex animo petere non possim. Ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m
      <lb/>de hac re satis.</p>
  <p><lb/>Evolvens Nuper <rs type="keyword">Diarii Litteratorum Itali<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> tomum deci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mum nonum casu incidi in <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_6MW47K34">articulum VII</rs> cui titulus
      <lb/>est. <hi rend="u">Domini Comitis <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Jacobi Riccati</rs> Responsio ad aliqu<subst><del>as</del><add>ot</add></subst> oppo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sitiones factas a Domino <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johanne Bernoulli</rs>, solutioni
      <lb/>problematis inversi virium centralium in vacuo in ra<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tione reciproca quadratorum distantiarum; quam so<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lutionem publicavit <abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Jacobus Hermannus</rs> Diarii
      <lb/><rs type="biblio" key="biblio_9PULRZTZ">Litteratorum Itali<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> tomo secundo <abbr>articul.</abbr> XV.</rs></hi> Face<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re non possum amiciti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> legibus ductus quin <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruum</rs>
      <lb/>Tuum Doctissimum huius responsionis commonefaciam:
<pb facs="1063911" n="3"/>
      <lb/>quam libenter latine vertissem si temporis angustia id
      <lb/>mihi permisisset. <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_6MW47K34">Responsionem igitur integram cum fi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gura</rs><note type="comment">Die mitgesandte Figur ist in Riccatis Aufsatz als <ref target="https://archive.org/details/s1id13301660/page/210/mode/2up">Tafel I</ref> zu p. 210 abgedruckt.</note> adiecta, <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_3RJU6R8K">Diario</rs><note type="comment">Zu Riccatis Aufsatz sind handschriftliche Bemerkungen Johann I Bernoullis überliefert, möglicherweise unter Mitwirkung von Nicolaus I (UB Basel, L I a 13.11, <ref target="../about/work_catalogue_johann_i#johib-work-ms-353.01">Ms 353.01</ref>). Johann I sandte die Antwort von Nicolaus I mit seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515018605501">Brief</rs> vom 27. März 1715 an Michelotti. Dieser übersetzte sie ins Italienische und liess sie als <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_65T3BHVK"><hi rend="u">Annotazioni sopra lo Schediasma di Jacopo Riccato</hi></rs> im selben Journal veröffentlichen.</note> extractam ad vos mitto ut eam
      <lb/>legatis. <abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patruus</rs> aut Tu si aliquid respondendum,
      <lb/>notandum aut animadvertendum habebitis super <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_6MW47K34">res<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ponsionem</rs> <abbr>D.</abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119543885" type="person">Comitis Jacobi Riccati</rs><choice><sic>;</sic><corr>,</corr></choice> poteritis ad me
      <lb/>transmittere quicquid vobis lubebit: ego etenim <subst><del>vestras</del><add>vestras</add></subst>
      <lb/>responsiones aut animadv<unclear>e</unclear>rsiones quamprimum publi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ci iuris fieri in Diario Litteratorum Itali<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, curabo.
      <lb/>Ego interim in <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_69NKSR46">Montmortii librum</rs> meritaque Tua
      <lb/>Tibi gratias ago; et ne desistas hortari <abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Patru<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>ut oblatum Stipendium non recuset, rogo.</p>
  <closer><salute>Cura ut va<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>leas.</salute> <dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1715-02-22">22 Februarii 1715</date>.</dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1063912" n="4" type="empty"/>

</div></body></text></TEI>
